// Phase 1.0 router-baseline.
//
// Validates that Claude picks the right tool family for an utterance. Each
// row is JSON. Comments / blank lines are skipped by the runner.
// Required keys: input, expected_tool (use null for "no tool").
// Optional: label, expected_args_match (deep subset), expected_text_pattern (regex).
//
// Two passes through the harness:
//   1) Now (Phase 1.0) — checks routing only; no tool actually executes.
//      Expected pass rate: 18/20 per the dev plan §5 exit gate.
//   2) After Phase 1.6 — same dataset; tools execute end-to-end.
